# Cursor Rules: Hackathon Multi-Device KMP/CMP System
 
1. Always refer to [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [.agents/rules/](.agents/rules/) for project invariants and architecture.
2. Built-in Commands & Auto-Expansion:
   - Plain English Instructions: Any instruction (with or without `/boost`) is automatically deconstructed and expanded via PEP (`INV-BOOST-01`).
   - `/boost [instruction]`: Explicitly expands prompts into complete Clean Architecture code with full edge cases.
   - `/plan [concept]`: Breaks down problem statements into a time-budgeted 4-hour execution roadmap with volunteer handoff mode.
   - `/learn [lesson]`: Captures debugging and platform insights into `Docs/learnings/hackathon_learnings.md` (`INV-LEARN-01`).
3. Maintain strict Clean Architecture (`INV-ARCH-01`):
   - `domain`: Pure Kotlin, zero Android or Compose UI imports.
   - `data`: Repositories with offline mock fallback engine (`INV-MOCK-01`) and `resetToSeedData()`.
   - `presentation`: MVI / UDF with StateFlow (`UiState`, `UiIntent`, `UiEffect`) extending `BaseMviViewModel` with `safeLaunch`.
   - `ui`: Compose Multiplatform with adaptive navigation (`NavigationSuiteScaffold`).
4. Edge-Case Defense Matrix (`INV-EDGE-01`):
   - Implement `EmptyStateCard`, `ErrorStateCard` (with retry), and `LoadingSkeletonCard`.
   - Dynamic text must use `maxLines` and `overflow = TextOverflow.Ellipsis`.
   - Soft keyboard avoidance with `AdaptiveFormLayout` (`imePadding()` and vertical scrolling).
   - Validated inputs using `ValidatedInputField` with inline errors and clear button.
   - Prevent double-click spam using `debouncedClickable()` with ripple preserved.
   - Demo transparency using `DemoModeBanner` with offline mock toggle.
   - Clamp widescreen desktop layouts using `AdaptiveContainer(maxWidth = 1200.dp)`.
5. Follow Dhruv's Design Tokens (`INV-UI-01`):
   - Capsule shape buttons (`CircleShape` / `Spacing.buttonCornerRadius = 100.dp`).
   - 48dp minimum touch target (`Spacing.minTouchTarget = 48.dp`).
   - 24dp card corner radius (`Spacing.cardCornerRadius = 24.dp`).
6. Zero main thread blocking (`INV-THREAD-01`): Use `withContext(Dispatchers.Default)` or `Dispatchers.IO`.
7. Installed Skills Utilization (`INV-SKILL-01`): Proactively consult and leverage installed skills in `~/.gemini/config/skills` and `~/.agents/skills` (e.g. `adaptive`, `navigation-3`, `edge-to-edge`, `styles`, `litert-lm`, `litert-runtime`, `testing-setup`, `verify`).
8. All markdown links MUST be relative (e.g. `[architecture.md](Docs/architecture.md)`).
9. DO NOT COMMIT or run git push commands (`INV-COMMIT-01`).
